  "description": "Full-matrix spectrum of the block-swap braid β (two 3-strand blocks) on the H₆ seminormal rep, per λ⊢6. β is a BRAID (β²=full twist≠id) on a reducible module, so it has more than the Hecke {q,−q⁻¹} eigenvalues — 22 distinct across all blocks. The exact q-correct spectral projector is therefore a degree-21 polynomial in β, needing tr_M(W·β^k) for k=0..21; the #2120 {id,β} scalar reweighting (k≤1) is insufficient. Quantifies the owner's 'don't assume scalar' correction and sets the power-set for the exact block-swap S_atom.",
